  <div>
   Jub Aaiyae Baligh Tere Tewar Nazar Aaie.....3
   <br>
   <br>Dunia Me Ali (A.s.) Sub Se Kadawar Nazar Aaie
   <br>Jub Ayaa E Ballig Tere Tewar Nazar Aaie
   <br>
   <br>Suraj Ki Kahin Dhoop Kahin Ishk Ka Saaya.....2
