   <br>Jub Ayaa E Ballig Tere Tewar Nazar Aaie
   <br>
   <br>Elan Wilayat Ka Hazaron Ne Suna Tha.....2
   <br>Mangi Jo Shahadat To Bahattar Nazar Aaie
   <br>Jub Ayaa e Ballig Tere Tewar Nazar Aaie
   <br>
   <br>Hathon Se Mere Chut Gaya Sagar E Kausar.....2
